  "bodyHash": "083015a08d6b9d69",
  "content": "\n\n<p>已更新至版本 1.21.11<br>抱歉花了這麼久，但我一直期待 Optifine 終於能完成。</p>\n<p>已變更至 Minecraft 版本 1.21.11：</p>\n<p>新增 copper_torch、copper_lantern、copper_shofel、-pickaxe、-axe、-hoe、copper_sword 與護甲，<br>不同款式的架子、長矛、傀儡雕像、copper_golem、copper_nugget，<br>新增 nautilus 與 zombie_nautilus、nautilus 護甲，<br>bogged、camel_husk、parched，<br>新增溫暖與寒冷型的牛、豬、雞，<br>目前溫帶型的牛、雞和豬在 Optifine 中尚未變更，<br>還有不同的箱子，它們可以運作但材質尚未正確顯示&hellip;:(</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">各位親愛的我的世界玩家大家好！我是 Norzeteus，想邀請大家來看看</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我的全新資源包「Space」。為我創作出帶有未來主義風格的材質是一大挑戰</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（靈感來自《創：光速戰記》），在 GUI 中加入一點「復古風」，並讓遊戲內的「日常生活與合成」保持自然</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">並將這些元素融合在一起。希望我成功了……</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">下載後，將材質包 zip 檔案放入 Minecraft 的資源資料夾，就像大多數高解析度材質包一樣，</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:14pt\">需要 Optifine，為了正常運作，Optifine 是絕對必要的，&nbsp;請選擇對應&nbsp;的檔案！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#00f;font-size:14pt\">此資源包與我所有的其他數據包相容！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#00f\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">「Space - Extended - ForgeMod」（僅限版本 1.12）（需安裝 Optifine！）</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0f0;font-size:14px\">在此獲取：<a style=\"color:#0f0\" href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/space-extended-mod/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/space-extended-mod/files</a></span><br><span style=\"color:#00f;font-size:14px\">請閱讀內部說明！</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#00f;font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14pt\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12px\">現在您可以在我的「太空建築套裝」中獲得約 30 種太空建築！</span></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/norzeteus-space-buildings-bundle\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/norzeteus-space-buildings-bundle</a></span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif\">此外還有用於改善太空地景的附加模組，在此獲取：</span>&nbsp;</span></span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"line-height:1.7\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/norzeteus-space-1-8-1-12-addon-128x/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/norzeteus-space-1-8-1-12-addon-128x/files</a></span></span></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#008000\">&nbsp;Optifine 下載連結：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://optifine.net/downloads</a></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YGkT5pYGiR8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h4><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/21wj3HtRx-I?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>&nbsp;<span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nJo8B7FA0EE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10px;line-height:1.7\">YouTube：</span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9ewY9AiiHuE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Raf2ap3Uk3E&list=UUajSJ1HMDs1E9MAfzF2pLJQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"line-height:1.7\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Raf2ap3Uk3E&amp;list=UUajSJ1HMDs1E9MAfzF2pLJQ</span></a></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"http://www.youtube.com/embed/Raf2ap3Uk3E?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
